    "detailed_description": "This is a bicycle trial game in which the player must ride a bicycle across a bridge in the sky.<br>The road is never smooth, and there are many detours and obstacles in your way.<br>Overcome every obstacle and ride to the goal.<br><br><strong>What's this?</strong><br>Ride a bicycle across a single bridge in the sky.<br>In addition to moving forward and backward and jumping, you can lift the front and rear wheels.<br>You must overcome obstacles in the course to reach the goal on the other side of the river.<br>If you deviate from the course, you will fall into the abyss.<br><br>Over 30 different courses!<br>In random mode, the courses are almost endless!<br><br><strong>Course editor</strong><br>Original course data can be created by determining the course trajectory.<br>Course data will be saved in the application server, so courses created by other players will also appear.",
